UPDATE companies SET description='Tecnova Electronics, Inc. is headquartered in Waukegan, Illinois. The company traces its roots to 1981 when Terry Coleman Sr., after gaining experience in electronic design, founded Tecnova Inc. to offer electronic and firmware design services from his home. In 1987, Tecnova Electronics, Inc. was established to combine design and contract manufacturing under one roof, creating a single-source solution for electronics production. The business remains led by the Coleman family, with Terry Coleman Sr. as CEO of Tecnova, Inc. and Terence Coleman Jr. as President of the Electronics division.

The company provides comprehensive electronic manufacturing services, specializing in printed circuit board assembly (SMT and through-hole), electro-mechanical assembly, box builds, cable and wire harness assembly, and inspection and testing including in-house X-ray and automated optical inspection (AOI). Its ISO 9001:2015-certified facility operates multiple high-speed SMT production lines with high-accuracy pick-and-place systems, and offers conformal coating with silicone and acrylic materials. Tecnova handles odd-formed parts such as large connectors and Pem-nuts, and supports production volumes from prototype through mid-volume to large-scale runs. Additional capabilities include product development services such as electronic prototyping, motor drive development, power electronics design, and project management.

Tecnova serves mid-sized original equipment manufacturers (OEMs) across industrial electronics sectors, including industrial sensing, monitoring, and controls, motor drive systems, and power electronics. The company maintains partnerships as an Analog Devices Design Partner and a member of the Hirose Solution Partner Network, indicating engagement with component suppliers and technology ecosystems. Customers typically seek a seamless integration of design and manufacturing to avoid finger-pointing between separate vendors.

Tecnova differentiates itself through its "design-it-right, build-it-right" philosophy, embedding quality at every stage rather than relying solely on end-of-line inspection. The firm has been recognized multiple times as a Quality Leadership 100 company by Quality Magazine, including the #1 ranking in 2024. By offering both engineering design and contract manufacturing under common ownership, Tecnova aims to provide accountability and smoother project outcomes for clients.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001:2015 (Intertek)','RoHS']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["PCB Assembly (SMT)", "PCB Assembly (Through-Hole)", "Electro-Mechanical Assembly", "Box Build Assembly", "Cable and Wire Harness Assembly", "Inspection and Testing (X-Ray)", "Inspection and Testing (AOI)", "Conformal Coating (Silicone)", "Conformal Coating (Acrylic)", "Odd-Formed Parts Assembly (Large Connectors)", "Odd-Formed Parts Assembly (Pem-Nuts)", "High-Speed SMT Assembly", "Turnkey Electronic Manufacturing Services", "Electronic Product Development", "Motor Drive Development", "Electronic Prototyping", "Power Electronics Development", "Project Management", "Industrial Sensing, Monitoring, and Controls"], "industries": ["OEMs (Mid-sized)", "Industrial Electronics", "Industrial Sensing, Monitoring, and Controls", "Motor Drive Systems", "Power Electronics"], "materials": [], "equipment": ["High-speed surface mount assembly lines", "High-accuracy pick-and-place systems", "In-house X-ray inspection", "Automated optical inspection (AOI)"], "volume": "Prototype to large-scale production", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Single-source solution: design and manufacturing under one roof", "\"Design-it-right, build-it-right\" quality philosophy", "In-house X-ray and AOI inspection", "Multiple high-speed SMT lines with high-accuracy pick-and-place", "Quality Leadership 100 awards (2024 #1)"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters: Waukegan, Illinois -> db", "Founding: 1981 (Tecnova Inc.), 1987 (Tecnova Electronics, Inc.) -> /about-us", "Founder: Terry Coleman Sr. -> /about-us", "Leadership: Terry Coleman Sr. (CEO), Terence Coleman Jr. (President), Sean O''Day (SVP) -> /about-us", "Services: PCB assembly, electro-mechanical assembly, box builds, cable/harness, inspection/testing -> /services", "Equipment: multiple high-speed SMT lines, pick-and-place, in-house X-ray & AOI -> /services", "Conformal coating: silicone and acrylic -> / (capabilities list)", "Odd-formed parts: large connectors, Pem-nuts -> / (products list)", "Certifications: ISO 9001:2015 (Intertek), RoHS -> /quality, db", "Quality awards: Quality Leadership 100 (2024 #1, 2021 #4, 2020 #1, 2019 #2, 2016, 2015, 2014) -> /quality", "Industry memberships: Global Electronics Association, SMTA -> /quality", "Partnerships: Analog Devices Design Partner, Hirose Solution Partner Network -> /, /services", "Volume: Prototype to full-scale production, mid-volume to large-scale -> /, /services", "Philosophy: design-it-right, build-it-right -> /about-us", "Single-source solution: design and manufacturing under one roof -> /about-us"], "company_type": "Contract manufacturer / job shop", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Electronic Contract Manufacturer", "founded_year": "1987", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='tecnova-electronics-inc' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
