UPDATE companies SET description='Texas Components Corporation was founded in 1996 in Houston, Texas. The company operates as a U.S.-based manufacturer of precision discrete electronic components, custom packages, and proprietary multi-chip modules.

The company specializes in high-temperature, low-temperature, and high-precision or high-power applications. It is the largest independent manufacturer and marketer of Bulk Metal® Foil resistors in the United States, with over 30 years of experience in complex designs. As a licensed and certified Precision Center, Texas Components is an authorized part of the Vishay Precision Group global supply chain, producing and distributing standard Vishay Foil Resistors alongside its own custom designs and derivative products. The firm also provides custom design and testing services, including pre- and post-manufacturing operations such as parametric screening, set-matching, power conditioning, burn-in, and life testing.

Texas Components serves customers in test and measurement, calibration, and electronics manufacturing who require precision resistors, calibration standards, RTD and thermistor accessories, strain gauge and bridge circuit accessories, and special shunt resistors.

Its experienced applications engineers and sales staff support customers from design through production.', certifications=ARRAY['Vishay Precision Group licensed and certified Precision Center']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom design and testing services", "Pre and post manufacturing operations", "Parametric screening", "Set-matching", "Power conditioning", "Burn-in testing", "Life testing", "Multi-chip module design and manufacturing", "Bulk Metal Foil resistor manufacturing", "Resistor calibration standards production", "RTD and thermistor accessory manufacturing", "Strain gauge and bridge circuit accessory manufacturing", "Special shunt resistor manufacturing", "Original Naked Bulk Metal Foil resistor manufacturing", "Vishay Foil resistor distribution"], "industries": [], "materials": ["Bulk Metal\u00ae Foil"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "Less than one week for some designs", "tolerances": "", "built_on": [], "facts_used": ["Founded in 1996 -> db", "Headquarters in Houston, Texas -> db", "Manufacturer of precision electronic components -> /", "Custom packages and multi-chip modules -> /", "Specializing in high temperature, low temperature, high precision, high power applications -> /", "Largest independent manufacturer of Bulk Metal Foil resistors in USA -> /", "Over 30 years experience -> /", "Licensed and certified Precision Center -> /", "Authorized part of Vishay Precision Group global supply chain -> /", "No minimum order quantity -> /", "Delivery in less than one week possible -> /", "Stocking programs and JIT delivery -> /", "Pre and post manufacturing operations and testing services (parametric screening, set-matching, power conditioning, burn-in, life-tests) -> /", "Products: resistors, calibration standards, RTD/thermistor accessories, strain gauge accessories, shunt resistors -> /"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Texas Components is a U S A based manufacturer of precision discrete electronic components", "founded_year": "1996", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "No minimum order quantity", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='texas-components-corporation' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Texas Direct Solar is a family-owned solar installation and service company based in Houston, Texas. Founded in 2017, the business was started with the goal of providing honest, affordable solar energy solutions to local homeowners and businesses. The company operates under Texas Electrical Contractor License #34757 and employs a fully Houston-based crew.

The company offers a full range of solar services including custom residential and commercial system design and installation, battery backup integration (Tesla Powerwall, Generac PWRcell, Enphase, Franklin), solar panel detach-and-reset for roof replacements, and repair and maintenance for all major brands such as SunPower, Enphase, SolarEdge, and Tesla. They handle permitting, utility interconnection, and provide annual maintenance plans. Their licensed electricians perform pre-removal inspections, coordinate directly with roofing contractors, and conduct post-reinstall system testing.

Texas Direct Solar serves residential customers across Houston and surrounding counties (Harris, Fort Bend, Montgomery, Brazoria, Chambers, Galveston, Liberty) as well as commercial clients including warehouses, industrial facilities, retail and restaurant spaces, office buildings, churches, nonprofits, and multi-family housing. They also work with insurance companies for claim documentation.

The company differentiates itself through its family-owned, community-first approach, emphasizing straight talk, fair upfront pricing, and long-term accountability. They are certified by Enphase, Generac, Tesla, and Franklin, and hold OSHA 10 certification. Their detach-and-reset service includes a pre-removal inspection to document issues upfront, ensuring warranties remain valid.', certifications=ARRAY['Texas Electrical Contractor License #34757','Enphase Certified','Generac Certified Clean Energy Installer','Tesla Solar Certified','Franklin Battery Authorized','OSHA 10 Certified']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Residential solar system design and installation", "Commercial solar system design and installation", "Battery backup system installation (Tesla Powerwall, Generac PWRcell, Enphase, Franklin)", "Solar panel detach and reset for roof replacement", "Solar repair and maintenance (inverter, panel, wiring)", "System diagnostics and performance troubleshooting", "Annual solar maintenance plans", "Electrical contracting services (Texas license #34757)", "Permitting and utility interconnection management", "Insurance claim documentation for solar damage", "Monitoring system setup and 25-year monitoring included"], "industries": ["Residential construction", "Commercial construction", "Industrial facilities", "Retail and hospitality", "Religious institutions", "Multi-family housing", "Renewable energy installation", "Electrical contracting", "Insurance restoration"], "materials": ["Tier 1 solar panels", "Lithium-ion battery systems (Tesla Powerwall, Generac PWRcell, Franklin Battery)", "Electrical wiring and conduit", "Mounting and racking hardware"], "equipment": ["Tesla Powerwall (13.5 kWh)", "Generac PWRcell", "Enphase microinverters", "SolarEdge inverters", "SunPower solar panels", "Franklin Battery systems", "SPAN Smart Panel"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Pre-removal inspection before any panel removal", "Licensed elect