UPDATE companies SET description='Texas Metal Works operates from a 40,000-square-foot, climate-controlled facility in Conroe, Texas. The company was founded in 2017 by brothers John and Kirk Pozadzides, who started the business after failing to find quality, affordable American-made fabrication tables for their own shop. They built the first tables for themselves, then brought them to market.

The company manufactures professional-grade welding tables, modular welding booths, heavy-duty workbenches, plasma cutting tables, DIY welding kits, and the ModPro modular storage system. Production runs on precision laser cutters, CNC press brakes, and robotic welding cells, with in-house powder coating available in over 200 colors. Texas Metal Works offers more than 40 standard table variants in sizes from 30″×30″ to 70″×140″, all cut from ASTM A572-50 structural steel milled in the U.S. It also produces the only readily available stainless-steel fabrication table line in the domestic market.

Customers range from hobbyist garages and small fabrication shops to large production facilities, as well as school districts, community colleges, and CTE programs nationwide. The stainless tables serve contamination-sensitive sectors such as food-grade, pharmaceutical, aerospace, and high-purity welding. Structural steel fabrication services support commercial, industrial, and institutional projects.

Texas Metal Works emphasizes its ISO 9001 certified quality system, AWS-certified welders, and a 100% debt-free, brother-owned structure that answers only to customers. Manufacturing, fabrication, shipping, and U.S.-based support all operate under one roof, allowing control over tolerances, flatness, and lead times without third-party handoffs.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001','AWS certified welders']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Laser cutting (precision)", "CNC press-brake forming", "Robotic welding", "MIG welding", "TIG welding", "Stick welding", "Flux core welding", "Industrial powder coating (in-house, 200+ colors, up to 12 ft parts)", "Plate rolling (cylindrical and conical)", "Metal bending and forming", "Custom metal fabrication", "Structural steel fabrication", "Welded assemblies fabrication", "ModPro modular storage system manufacturing", "Welding table manufacturing", "Welding booth manufacturing", "Workbench manufacturing", "Plasma cutting table manufacturing", "DIY welding kit manufacturing", "Accessory manufacturing"], "industries": ["Fabrication shops", "Hobby shops", "Production shops", "Educational institutions (schools, community colleges, CTE programs)", "Food-grade manufacturing", "Pharmaceutical manufacturing", "Aerospace", "High-purity welding applications", "Commercial construction", "Industrial construction", "Institutional construction"], "materials": ["ASTM A572-50 structural steel (U.S.-made)", "Stainless steel", "Carbon steel", "Aluminum"], "equipment": ["Precision laser cutting equipment", "CNC press-brake forming equipment", "Robotic welding cells", "Industrial powder coating facility", "Plate rolling equipment", "Press brake forming equipment"], "volume": "Prototype to production runs", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Largest U.S.-based welding table manufacturer", "Only standard stainless-steel fabrication table line available domestically", "ISO 9001 certified with AWS-certified welders", "100% debt-free, privately owned by two brothers", "All manufacturing, fabrication, shipping, and support under one roof in Texas"], "facts_used": ["Founded 2017 -> /about", "Privately owned by two brothers John and Kirk Pozadzides -> /about", "ISO 9001 certified -> /about, db", "Largest US-based welding table manufacturer -> /about", "40,000 sq ft facility -> /services", "Climate-controlled facility in Conroe, Texas -> /about", "Over 40 standard table variants -> /about", "Only stainless steel fabrication table line on the market -> /about", "ASTM A572-50 structural steel -> /about", "AWS certified welders -> /services", "Industrial powder coating in-house -> /services", "Plate rolling capabilities -> /services", "Precision laser cutting, CNC press-brake forming, robotic welding -> /about", "Serves schools/CTE programs -> /about", "Serves food-grade, pharmaceutical, aerospace, high-purity welding -> /about", "100% debt free -> /about", "All operations under one roof -> /about", "Team members: John P, Kirk P, Eric Juel, Mohit Kamat, Austin Gore, Christian Kirkpatrick -> /about", "20+ years in business -> /services", "Free shipping over $1,000 -> /about", "Net-30 terms for schools -> /about"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Texas Metal Works is the largest US-based welding table manufacturer, producing precision fabrication tables from American-made ASTM A572-50 structural steel at its climate-controlled facility in Conroe, Texas.", "founded_year": "2017", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='texas-metal-works' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
