UPDATE companies SET description='The Iron Works Ltd. has operated from Des Moines, Iowa since 1984, when Charles Punelli took ownership of the business.

The company runs a 22,000-square-foot production facility equipped for MIG/TIG welding, plasma cutting, shearing, press-brake forming, ironworker operations, and overhead crane handling. It specializes in custom-built steel staircases and also produces planters, mailboxes, and one-off prototypes, offering design and development support alongside fabrication. Detailing services and mirror-finish polishing round out the in-house capabilities, and a fleet of private delivery trucks handles on-site logistics.

Concrete examples include ice-protection solutions for broadcast-tower electronics, architectural staircases for building projects, and custom planters for landscape installations.

The firm emphasizes reliability and a willingness to take on jobs that other shops decline, promising to meet deadlines and "do what it takes to make sure the job is done right." Its differentiators include a no-job-too-big-or-small philosophy, dedicated delivery, and high-end finishing such as mirror polishing.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom metal fabrication", "Custom-built steel staircases", "Planter fabrication", "Mailbox fabrication", "Prototyping", "Design and development", "Broadcast tower ice protection solutions", "Detailing services", "MIG/TIG welding", "Plasma cutting", "Catalina torch cutting", "Shearing", "Press brake forming", "Ironworker operations", "Overhead crane handling", "Mirror finish polishing", "Private delivery and on-site logistics"], "industries": ["Construction", "Architectural metalwork", "Telecommunications", "Landscaping", "Residential", "Commercial"], "materials": ["Steel", "Certified American-manufactured steel"], "equipment": ["MIG/TIG welding equipment", "Plasma cutting equipment", "Catalina torches", "Shears", "Press brakes", "Ironworkers", "Overhead cranes", "Mirror finish polishing equipment", "Private delivery trucks"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Takes on jobs other companies won''t", "Meets deadlines consistently", "Private delivery trucks for on-site deliveries", "Detailing and mirror-finish polishing services", "22,000 sq ft production facility"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1984, owned by Charles Punelli -> /about", "22,000 sq ft facility -> /capabilities", "Custom metal fabrication, staircases, planters, mailboxes, prototyping, design -> /capabilities", "Equipment: MIG/TIG welding, plasma cutting, Catalina torches, shears, press brakes, ironworkers, overhead cranes, mirror finish polishing -> /capabilities", "Private delivery trucks -> /capabilities", "Industries: broadcast tower (telecom), construction, architectural, landscaping, residential, commercia