UPDATE companies SET description='Three R Plastics Inc. operates from Spring Grove, Illinois, where it was founded in 1994. Three generations of the founding family work together in the business, which has grown steadily since its start.

The company combines injection molding and mold making under one roof, running a full-service mold manufacturing shop in-house. Nearly all of the molds it builds — about 99 percent — are run in its own molding department. It also accepts transfer molds and provides mold servicing for customers who lack that capability. Its precision injection molding covers parts from smaller than a fingernail up to several pounds, using a wide range of resins including glass- and carbon-filled grades and high-temperature materials such as PEEK and Ultem. Swiss lathes are used for custom production pieces and to supplement molding with overmolded materials.

The company serves a wide range of markets, though specific industries are not detailed in its public materials.

What distinguishes the operation is the integration of mold building and molding in a single facility, allowing tight control from tool design through production. The ability to take on transfer molds and service existing tooling extends that control to projects that originated elsewhere.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Injection molding", "Mold making", "Overmolding", "Transfer mold acceptance", "Mold servicing", "Precision molding of small to medium parts"], "industries": [], "materials": ["Glass-filled resins", "Carbon-filled resins", "PEEK", "Ultem", "Wide range of commodity and engineering resins"], "equipment": ["Swiss lathes"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Injection molding and mold making under one roof", "Full-service mold manufacturing in-house", "Nearly 99% of molds built are run in their own molding department", "Accepts transfer molds and provides mold servicing", "Swiss lathes for custom production and overmolding"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 1994 -> db, page /", "Headquarters Spring Grove, Illinois -> db, page /", "Family-owned, three generations -> page /", "Injection molding and mold making under one roof -> page /", "Full service mold manufacturing in-house -> page /", "99% of molds built run in-house -> page /", "Accepts transfer molds and services molds -> page /", "Precision injection molding specialty -> page /", "Part size range: smaller than fingernail to several pounds -> page /", "Materials: glass/carbon filled, PEEK, Ultem -> page /", "Swiss lathes for custom production and overmolding -> page /, capabilities db"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Full service Mold Manufacturing all in house. Nearly 99% of the molds we build are run in our molding department.", "founded_year": "1994", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": ["Family-owned"]