UPDATE companies SET description='Timbercraft Custom Dovetail Drawers was founded in 2003 in New Milford, Connecticut. The company began by specializing in custom dovetail drawers for cabinetmakers, millworkers, and contractors throughout the Northeast.

The company operates a lean manufacturing facility that produces custom dovetail drawers with a consistent 3-5 day turnaround. Drawers are made from select or better grades of maple and birch, with 5/8-inch side thickness, 1/16-inch radius top edges, and 3/8-inch Baltic birch bottoms. A 100% solid UV coating provides a hard, uniform, solvent-free finish. Heights range from 2 1/8 inches to 12 1/8 inches for birch and 11 3/8 inches for maple, with edge-glue panel techniques allowing heights up to 22 3/8 inches. Widths and depths run from 3 inches to 58 inches for birch and 43 3/4 inches for maple.

Timbercraft serves cabinetmakers, millworkers, and general contractors across the Northeast, including the Tri-State area where palletized orders ship next business day via LTL. The company does not offer value, budget, or economy grade drawers, emphasizing premium materials and refusing to recover scrap wood for drawer components.

The company highlights its consistent 3-5 day turnaround, unmatched customer service, and premium material selection as key differentiators. Orders are acknowledged by email and, once approved and released into production, cannot be changed. Credit cards are kept on file and charged the day before completion, and all freight charges are prepaid and included in acknowledgments.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom dovetail drawer manufacturing", "Lean production with 3-5 day turnaround", "UV coating application", "Order acknowledgment and scheduling", "LTL and UPS shipping", "Online order processing", "Edge glue panel techniques for tall drawers"], "industries": ["Cabinetmaking", "Millwork", "General contracting"], "materials": ["Maple", "Birch", "Baltic Birch"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "3-5 days", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Consistent 3-5 day turnaround times", "Unmatched customer service", "Premium materials: select or better grades of maple and birch, no scrap recovery", "100% solid UV coating, solvent-free finish", "Lean manufacturing facility"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 2003 -> db", "Headquarters in New Milford, Connecticut -> db", "Specializes in custom dovetail drawers for cabinetmakers, millworkers, contractors in Northeast -> db", "Lean manufacturing facility with 3-5 day turnaround -> /", "Materials: select or better grades of maple and birch, Baltic birch bottoms -> /", "Drawer specs: 5/8\" side thickness, 1/16\" radius top edges, 3/8\" Baltic birch bottoms -> /", "Finish: 100% solid UV coating, solvent-free -> /", "Height ranges: birch 2 1/8\"-12 1/8\", maple 2 1/8\"-11 3/8\", up to 22 3/8\" with edge glue -> /", "Width/depth ranges: birch 3\"-58\", maple 3\"-43 3/4\" -> /", "Shipping: LTL next day Tri-State, 2-3 days outside, UPS Ground -> /", "Order policies: acknowledgments, no changes after production release, credit card on file -> /", "No value/budget/economy grades, no scrap recovery -> /",