UPDATE companies SET description='Tischler Wood Products, Inc. is based in Avon, Minnesota, and was founded in 1994 by Bryan Tischler, who serves as president and CEO. The company began as a small operation and has grown steadily, now training the next generation of woodworkers while maintaining a team that includes long-tenured craftsmen such as Chuck, who rejoined after decades in the trade.

The shop produces custom cabinetry and millwork for virtually every room in a home: kitchens and islands, bathrooms, living rooms, mudrooms and laundry rooms, garages, home entertainment centers, offices and bedrooms. In-house capabilities cover design, estimating, project coordination, shop drawings, and installation, all managed by a dedicated project coordination team.

The company serves residential homeowners, general contractors, and interior designers throughout the Minneapolis area. Testimonials highlight projects ranging from a first-time homeowner''s kitchen remodel to a large custom home featuring painted white, bleached hickory, and stained alder cabinetry, along with rustic mantels and vaulted ceiling beams.

Tischler Wood emphasizes that quality never goes out of style, positioning unparalleled customer service and the highest quality cabinetry as its core differentiators. The firm also cites its commitment to a positive workplace and passing on work ethic and dedication to craft as reasons it was started and why it continues to operate.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom cabinetry", "Kitchen and island design", "Bathroom cabinetry", "Mudroom and laundry room storage", "Living room millwork", "Garage cabinetry", "Home entertainment centers", "Office and bedroom cabinetry", "Design and sales", "Project coordination", "Shop drawings", "Estimating", "Installation"], "industries": ["Residential construction", "Home remodeling", "Interior design", "Cabinetry", "Millwork"], "materials": ["Wood", "Hickory", "Alder", "Paint", "Stain"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Custom wood solutions since 1994", "In-house design, estimating, and project coordination", "Experienced team with 30+ years in cabinetry", "Commitment to training the next generation of woodworkers", "Unparalleled customer service with highest quality cabinetry"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 1994 -> db, /, /about-us", "Headquarters in Avon, Minnesota -> db, / (address 401 Blattner Dr, Avon, MN 56310)", "Founder Bryan is president and CEO -> /about-us", "Team includes Hannah, Jessica, Josh, Dee, Terry, Matt, Chuck -> /about-us", "Custom cabinetry for kitchens, bathrooms, living rooms, mudrooms, garages, home entertainment, offices, bedrooms -> /, /about-us", "Services include design, project coordination, shop drawings, estimating, installation -> /about-us", "Materials: hickory, alder, paint, stain -> / (testimonial)", "Differentiators: quality craftsmanship, customer service, training next generation -> /about-us", "Industries served: residential homeowners, contractors, designers -> /, /about-us"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "m