UPDATE companies SET description='Todd''s Warehouse (operating as Todd''s Foods) traces its roots to 1926 when Martin Todd and his wife Arlene began selling seasoning blends to meat lockers and markets in Des Moines, Iowa. The company expanded across the Midwest through a network of sales routes. In June 2011, Andy Holt acquired Todd''s LTD, and in October 2015 the business purchased the Summit Foods factory in Madison, Nebraska, adding liquid blending and packaging capacity. Today the company operates dry production facilities in Des Moines at the intersection of I-80 and I-235 and a liquid production plant in Madison, NE, positioning it for national distribution.

The company provides contract food manufacturing (co-packing), dry bulk blending, dry packaging, and liquid packaging services. Its liquid lines handle hot-fill products such as BBQ sauces, salsas, salad dressings, and vinegars in containers ranging from 10-ounce jars to large totes, and employ ozone sanitation for bottles and headspace. Dry capabilities include flexible stand-up pouches and various bulk, restaurant, and retail pack formats. A HACCP program and SQF certification govern food safety, while a Process Authority oversees acidified food processes. The firm also offers formulation development for kosher, organic, non-irradiated, GMO-free, and gluten-free requirements.

Customers include large commercial food manufacturers, restaurant chains, grocery delis, foodservice operators, retail brands, hospitals, and institutional buyers. Todd''s has helped entrepreneurs turn home recipes into commercial products sold on retail, hospital, restaurant, and institutional shelves. The company emphasizes customized production for medium to large orders and serves both established companies and start-ups.

Todd''s differentiates itself through its SQF certification, ozone sanitation, hot-fill and acidified process capabilities, and strategic Midwest locations that enable cost-effective shipping nationwide. The business highlights its 90-plus years of experience in seasonings and spices, award-winning products, and a focus on being a reliable partner for food packaging needs.', certifications=ARRAY['SQF Certification']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Contract food manufacturing (co-packing)", "Dry bulk blending", "Dry packaging (flexible stand-up pouches, various sizes and materials)", "Liquid packaging (BBQ sauces, salsas, salad dressings, vinegars, totes, gallons, jars down to 10 oz)", "Ozone sanitation for bottles and headspace", "Hot fill processes", "Acidified food processes with Process Authority oversight", "HACCP program", "Private labeling and packaging", "Formulation development (kosher, organic, non-irradiated, GMO-free, gluten-free)", "Seasonings and spices blending", "Retail packaging solutions", "Bulk and foodservice packaging solutions"], "industries": ["Food manufacturing", "Meat lockers", "Markets", "Packaging plants", "Restaurant chains", "Grocery delis", "Food service", "Retail", "Hospital", "Institutional", "Commercial food manufacturers", "Start-up food brands"], "materials": ["Food ingredients (kosher, organic, non-irradiated, GMO-free, gluten-free)", "Packaging materials (bottles, jars, totes, flexible stand-up pouches)"], "equipment": ["Ozone sanitation system", "Hot-fill production lines", "Liquid production lines"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["SQF certification for food safety and quality", "Ozone sanitation for bottles and headspace", "Hot-fill processes for liquid products", "Acidified food processes with Process Authority oversight", "Strategic Midwest locations (Des Moines, IA and Madison, NE) for logistics"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1926 by Martin Todd and Arlene -> /about", "Andy Holt acquired Todd''s LTD in June 2011 -> /about", "Purchased Summit Foods factory in Madison, NE in October 2015 -> /about", "Dry production in Des Moines, IA at I-80/I-235; liquid production in Madison, NE -> /about", "SQF Certification mentioned -> /", "HACCP program -> /", "Ozone sanitation for bottles and headspace -> /", "Hot fill processes -> /", "Acidified food processes with Process Authority -> /", "Contract food manufacturing (co-packing), dry bulk blending, dry packaging, liquid packaging -> /capabilities", "Products: BBQ sauces, salsas, salad dressings, vinegars, seasonings, spices -> /capabilities, /", "Packaging formats: totes, gallons, jars down to 10 oz, flexible stand-up pouches -> /capabilities", "Formulation development for kosher, organic, non-irradiated, GMO-free, gluten-free -> /capabilities", "Customers: large commercial manufacturers, restaurant chains, grocery delis, foodservice, retail, hospitals, institutions, start-ups -> /, /about", "Strategic Midwest locations for logistics -> /", "Over 90 years of experience in seasonings and spices -> /", "Award-winning products -> /", "Small business -> /about", "Headquarters: 4413 NE 14th Street, Des Moines, IA -> /"], "company_type": "Contract manufacturer / job shop", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Contract food manufacturing, also known as co-packing, is a strategic partnership where a brand owner outsources the production of their food or beverage products to a specialized third-party manufacturer.", "founded_year": "1926", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": ["Small business"]}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='todd-s-warehouse' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Tokyo Ohka Kogyo America Inc. (TOK America) operates from Hillsboro, Oregon, as the U.S. supply hub for its Japanese parent, Tokyo Ohka Kogyo Co., Ltd., a global leader in advanced chemical formulations.

The company manufactures both positive and negative photoresists, including g-line and advanced immersion formulations capable of forming features at the tens-of-nanometers scale. Its Hillsboro campus comprises several buildings where it produces a wide variety of liquid and powder chemistries. Beyond its own product lines, TOK America provides toll manufacturing, scaling from pilot batches to full commercial volumes, and supports customers with laboratory research, process development, equipment reconfiguration, and a full suite of inspection and analytical services. The inspection laboratory houses instruments such as ICP-MS, ICP-OES, gas and ion chromatographs, a Hitachi SEM, and a Nikon stepper.

Primary customers are semiconductor device makers and packaging houses in the U.S. and Europe, along with medical-device manufacturers. The firm also supplies auxiliary chemicals for semiconductor processing. All projects are conducted under confidentiality agreements, and the company emphasizes its 20-year U.S. manufacturing track record and strict health-and-safety programs for handling hazardous reagents.

TOK America differentiates itself through its ISO 14001-certified environmental management system (registered in 2004), its ability to handle highly corrosive, reactive, and carcinogenic materials safely, and its integrated service model that combines product engineering, packaging, labeling, warehousing, and logistics under one roof.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 14001']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Toll manufacturing", "Laboratory research and analysis", "Process development", "Pilot-to-mass-production scale-up", "Equipment reconfiguration and installation", "Hazardous chemical handling", "Product engineering", "Process engineering", "Raw materials management", "Inspection and analytical testing", "Batch preparation", "Quality control systems", "Warehousing", "Inventory services", "Product packaging", "Product labeling", "Customer service", "Shipping and logistics", "Documentation control"], "industries": ["Semiconductor", "Semiconductor manufacturing", "Semiconductor packaging", "Medical devices", "Chemical manufacturing"], "materials": ["Photoresists (positive and negative)", "High-purity chemical agents", "Corrosive materials", "Reactive hydrides", "Carcinogens"], "equipment": ["Elan DRC II ICPMS", "Nexion 300 Series ICPMS", "DV2500 ICP-OES", "8300 Series ICP-OES", "Gas Chromatograph", "Ion Chromatograph", "Coulometric and Volumetric KF Moisture Meters", "Automatic Viscometers", "Titrators", "UV Spectrophotometers", "Lauda-Brinkmann Surface Tensiometer", "FT-NIR", "Nikon Stepper", "Ellipsometers", "Hitachi SEM", "Coater and Developer DNS Track", "Nanometrics Film Thickness Meter"], "volume": "Pilot to mass production", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["20 years of U.S. manufacturing experience with hazardous chemistries", "ISO 14001 environmental certification maintained since 2004", "Toll manufacturing from pilot scale to commercial volumes", "Full-service inspection lab with ICP-MS, ICP-OES, SEM, and lithography tools", "Integrated packaging, labeling, warehousing, and logistics services"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters in Hillsboro, Oregon -> db", "Wholly owned subsidiary of Tokyo Ohka Kogyo -> /about-us", "Manufactures semiconductor photoresists and high-purity chemical agents -> /about-us", "Offers toll manufacturing services -> /services", "Operates several manufacturing buildings -> /services", "Provides laboratory research, analysis, and process development -> /services", "Scales from pilot to mass production -> /services", "Handles hazardous chemicals including corrosive materials, hydrides, carcinogens -> /services", "Maintains ISO 14001 certification since 2004 -> /about-us", "Inspection lab equipped with ICP-MS, ICP-OES, SEM, etc. -> /services", "Serves semiconductor manufacturers in US and Europe -> /about-us", "Serves medical device industry -> / (products list)", "20 years of manufacturing experience in the US -> /services", "Offers product packaging, labeling, warehousing, inventory services -> /services"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "TOK America has several buildings in which we manufacture a wide variety of products.", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='tokyo-ohka-kogyo-america-inc' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
