UPDATE companies SET description='Total Healthcare Solutions operates from Ridgeland, Mississippi, as a locally and privately owned durable medical equipment (DME) company. The firm does not disclose its founding year or founders, but presents itself as an accredited supplier focused on one-to-one relationships with patients and providers.

