UPDATE companies SET description='Total Packaging Company was founded in 1996 by Brian Schneider in Belmont, North Carolina. After a decade working for corrugated box manufacturers, Schneider left banking to create a one-stop shop for packaging and shipping materials. The business remains family-owned and operated, with a second location in Greenville, South Carolina.

