UPDATE companies SET description='Trinity Solar, based in Wall Township, New Jersey, was founded in 2012 according to company records.

The company specializes in residential solar panel installation, battery storage systems, and roofing services across New Jersey, Connecticut, and Delaware. Its process covers free in-home consultation, custom system design, permitting with local utilities and HOAs, and installation completed in one to three days by certified crews. Trinity reports more than 125,000 installations to date and has been ranked a Top Solar Contractor 12 times since 2012.

Trinity serves homeowners seeking to reduce electric bills and gain energy independence. Its customer base spans the Jersey Shore to Trenton, plus regions in Connecticut and Delaware. The company helps clients navigate state incentive programs such as New Jersey’s Successor Solar Incentive (SuSI), property and sales tax exemptions, and net metering.

Trinity emphasizes local relationships with utilities and regulators to accelerate permitting, advocates for policy changes benefiting solar adoption, and supports community organizations including the New Jersey Police Benevolent Association and Jersey Shore Boy Scouts Council. It offers a 25-year parts and labor guarantee and flexible financing with $0 down options.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Solar panel installation", "Battery storage installation", "Roofing services", "System design and engineering", "Permitting and utility coordination", "HOA approval management", "Net metering enrollment assistance", "Free in-home consultation", "Utility bill analysis", "Project concierge management", "Certified crew installation", "After-hours customer service", "Solar incentive navigation", "Financing options including $0 down"], "industries": ["Residential solar energy", "Renewable energy", "Roofing", "Energy storage", "Home improvement"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "1-3 days for installation", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Local utility and regulator relationships speed permitting and inspections", "Over 125,000 residential installations completed", "Ranked Top Solar Contractor 12 times since 2012", "25-year parts and labor guarantee", "Policy advocacy for solar-friendly legislation"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 2012 -> db", "Headquarters in Wall Township, New Jersey -> db", "125,000+ homes installed -> homepage", "30+ years in business claimed -> homepage", "Solar panel installation and battery storage -> homepage", "Roofing services in Connecticut and Delaware -> homepage", "Up to 25-year parts & labor guarantee -> homepage", "Ranked Top Solar Contractor 12 times since 2012 -> homepage", "Installation in 1-3 days -> homepage", "Local utility relationships speed permitting -> homepage", "Policy advocacy for solar adoption -> homepage", "Community giving to NJ PBA and Jersey Shore Boy Scouts -> homepage